                                        "entry_id": "1cbb0cd7-f2f9-34f3-ab8a-3d8a0e6cb05c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The event of small airborne particles falling to the ground in significant quantities as a result of major industrial activity, volcano eruption, sandstorm, nuclear explosion, etc."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d5668254-6045-428f-87b3-ab964151b673",
                                                "sense_id": "03b12fe4-581d-397e-a403-1c6765c4b588",
                                                "text": "It was 5 February 2010 and Safdar had already dealt with the fallout of one explosion that day: an hour before, a motorbike laden with explosives had slammed into a bus carrying Shia Muslims to a religious procession."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
